Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra stake-pool bls-registration-certificate offline 
                                                                              ( --registration-certificate-file FILEPATH
                                                                              | --pool-state-file FILEPATH
                                                                                --stake-pool-id STAKE_POOL_ID
                                                                                ( --current-params
                                                                                  ( --mainnet
                                                                                  | --testnet-magic NATURAL
                                                                                  )
                                                                                | --pending-params
                                                                                )
                                                                              )
                                                                              --bls-signing-key-file FILEPATH
                                                                              --out-file FILEPATH
                                                                              

  Create the certificate from the parameters in an existing stake pool
  registration certificate file or in a file written by query pool-state. No
  node connection is needed, but --current-params needs the network, because the
  query pool-state output does not record it.

Available options:
  --registration-certificate-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the stake pool registration
                           certificate to copy the parameters from.
  --pool-state-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the query pool-state output to take
                           the parameters from.
  --stake-pool-id STAKE_POOL_ID
                           Stake pool ID/verification key hash (either
                           Bech32-encoded or hex-encoded).
  --current-params         Keep the current parameters of the pool. Give the
                           network with --mainnet or --testnet-magic, because
                           the query pool-state output does not record it for
                           the reward account.
  --mainnet                Use the mainnet magic id. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_NETWORK_ID environment variable
  --testnet-magic NATURAL  Specify a testnet magic id. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_NETWORK_ID environment variable
  --pending-params         Keep the parameters of the pending update of the
                           pool.
  --bls-signing-key-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the BLS signing key.
  --out-file FILEPATH      The output file.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
